<http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "The Dublin Core Types namespace provides URIs for the entries of the DCMI Type Vocabulary. Entries are declared using RDF Schema language to support RDF applications. The Schema will be updated according to dc-usage decisions."@en-us;
